# PPSSPP master 83e616eaf97bd493f91944e5eced70d914b4bc18 (2026-10-28): PPSSPP_VFPU_RN=1 makes vadd/vsub/vmul/vdiv round to nearest with FTZ+DAZ, as the PSP-3000 (dev tool only, never shipped).
